sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Request A
    participant B as Request B
    participant API as Consumption Service
    participant Redis
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Primary
    participant KMS

    par Concurrent requests
        A->>API: POST /v/{token}/consume
        B->>API: POST /v/{token}/consume
    end

    API->>Redis: Check unavailable cache
    Redis-->>API: Miss

    par Conditional updates
        API->>DB: ACTIVE → CONSUMED RETURNING metadata
        API->>DB: ACTIVE → CONSUMED RETURNING metadata
    end

    DB-->>API: Request A updates 1 row
    DB-->>API: Request B updates 0 rows

    API->>Redis: Cache token as unavailable
    API-->>B: LINK_UNAVAILABLE
    API->>KMS: Unwrap data key
    KMS-->>API: DEK in memory
    API-->>A: Protected content
